{
  "name": "redeemable-vault",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Application that allows users to deposit tokens and later receive dividend payouts (proceeds) proportional to their tokens deposited initially. The business logic that governs how these proceeds are generated is out of scope for this exercise, the focus is mainly on token deposits and proceeds dispersion.",
